### ==========================================
### 验证码 — Captcha
### 路径前缀：/captcha
### 验证码模块无需登录即可访问
### ==========================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:9000

### ------------------- 获取验证码 -------------------
### @name Get Captcha
# 返回 Base64 格式的验证码图片和 key，key 在登录时传入 captchaKey
GET {{baseUrl}}/captcha HTTP/1.1

### ------------------- 验证验证码 -------------------
### @name Validate Captcha
POST {{baseUrl}}/captcha/validate HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "captchaKeyFromGet",
  "code": "aB3d"
}
